<title>USA: Lasertechnics considers sale of subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Lasertechnics considers sale of subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>CARROLLTON, Texas 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lasertechnics Inc said Wednesday that it has retained Southport Partners as financial advisor to advise on strategic alternatives for its Lasertechnics Marking Corp subsidiary, including the possibility of a sale or strategic partnership for it.</p>
<p>The company said, however, that it has not entered into any agreement about the unit, and there is no assurance any transaction concerning it will be consummated.</p>
</text>
